    "level": 2,
    "paras": [
     "The specific name, bahaeldini, is in honor of Egyptian zoologist Sherif M. Baha El Din, who is the husband of the late American-born herpetologist Mindy Baha El Din."
    ]
   },
   {
    "h": "Habitat",
    "level": 2,
    "paras": [
